<title>UK: Dalgety names new finance director.</title>
<headline>Dalgety names new finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British food company Dalgety Plc said on Tuesday that Kenneth Hanna will join the firm as finance director from May 1.</p>
</text>
